# Dependencies
/vendor/

# Composer
composer.phar
# NOTE: composer.lock is deliberately NOT ignored here — this repo commits
# it by S440 law (8a4d343; tests/SecurityAuditCheckTest.php's
# testTheCommittedLockExists asserts it, and the whole audit gate is built
# on the pinned lock). The pre-S440 scaffold carried an ignore line for it:
# the known family contradiction — it would make future legitimate lock
# updates unstageable without -f. Kept out on purpose, not an oversight.

